g%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_02-handoffs_bg.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK"/><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 z-1 hidden text-current md:block"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div><div class="grid gap-2"><h3 class="text-heading-5 w-11/12 max-w-lg">A seamless experience for customers and agents</h3><div class="text-body-lg text-current/80 w-11/12 max-w-xl text-pretty"><p>A single solution means<!-- --> <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai">Fin</a> <!-- -->and your human team work from the same customer record, so handoffs have full context, no one switches between tools, and every customer gets a consistent, seamless experience.</p></div><div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-span-full md:col-span-5"><div data-analytics-region="card-AI-powered Insights across every interaction" class="flex flex-col space-y-6"><div class="bg-chalk text-clay relative md:hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1"><img alt="Fin messenger UI" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="z-1 object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_03-insights_bg_mob.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 640w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_03-insights_bg_mob.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 750w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_03-insights_bg_mob.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl