 size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div><div class="grid gap-2"><h3 class="text-heading-5 w-11/12 max-w-lg">AI-powered Insights across every interaction</h3><div class="text-body-lg text-current/80 w-11/12 max-w-xl text-pretty"><p>Our AI engine automatically scores and organizes every conversation across<!-- --> <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai">Fin</a> <!-- -->and your human team, so you always understand quality, can spot emerging trends, and get alerted to what matters.</p></div><div><a class="text-inline-link mt-2 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" aria-label="Learn more about AI-powered Insights" href="https://fin.ai/insights">Learn more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="col-span-full"><div data-analytics-region="card-A self-improving system" class="flex flex-col space-y-6"><div class="bg-chalk text-clay relative md:hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1"><img alt="Fin messenger UI" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="z-1 object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product_Mob.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 640w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product_Mob.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 750w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product_Mob.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 828w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product_Mob.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1080w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2F