6ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 750w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 828w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1080w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1200w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1920w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 2048w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 3840w" src="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fen%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_04-self-improving_product.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK"/><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 z-1 hidden text-current md:block"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></div><div class="grid gap-2"><h3 class="text-heading-5 w-11/12 max-w-lg">A self-improving system</h3><div class="text-body-lg text-current/80 w-11/12 max-w-xl text-pretty"><p><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai">Fin</a> <!-- -->constantly improves by learning from your best human reps, and suggestions and assistance from Fin make your human team better. With everything in one system, managers get Recommendations on what to fix, from missing content to data integrations, and can act on them with one click.</p></div><div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="relative col-span-full grid grid-cols-10 gap-0 md:col-span-10"><div class="col-span-full mb-10 mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-x-4 lg:col-span-5 lg:my-0"><div class="flex max-w-[34ch] flex-col items-center space-y-4 pt-6 text-center lg:space-y-6 lg:py-12"><span class="text-label-lg flex items-center gap-x-2"><span class="bg-fin size-2"></span>Fin AI Agent</span><h3 class="text-heading-4 text-balance">A world-class AI Agent</h3><img alt="Fin AI Agent noodle illustration" loading="lazy" width="202" height="197" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_05_Fin_noodle.webp&amp;w=256&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1x, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_05_Fin_noodle.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 2x" src="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_05_Fin_noodle.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK"/><p class="text-body-lg mb-8">Fin is a world-class AI Agent trusted by many of the most forward-thinking businesses in the world, including<!-- --> <span><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai/customers/anthropic">Anthropic</a>, </span><span><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai/customers/clay">Clay</a>, </span><span><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai/customers/lightspeed">Lightspeed</a>, </span><span><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai/customers/rocket-money">Rocket Money</a>, </span><span><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="https://fin.ai/customers/gamma">Gamma</a></span>, and many<!-- --> <a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" aria-label="more Fin customers" href="https://fin.ai/customers">more</a>.</p><a class="font-inherit h-(--button-height) rounded-(--button-radius) px-(--button-padding-x) m-0 select-none items-center justify-center disabled:cursor-not-allowed bg-(--button-primary-background) text-(--button-primary-foreground) hover:bg-(--button-primary-hover-background) hover:text-(--button-primary-hover-foreground) hover:border-(--button-primary-hover-border) active:bg-(--button-primary-active-background) active:text-(--button-primary-active-foreground) disabled:bg-(--button-primary-disabled-background) disabled:text-(--button-primary-disabled-foreground) inline-flex focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" role="button" tabindex="0" aria-label="Learn more about Fin customers" href="https://fin.ai/customers">Learn more</a></div></div><div class="col-span-full lg:col-span-5"><div class="text-body bg-canvas relative flex aspect-square size-full items-center justify-center font-mono"><img alt="Fin AI Agent decorative background" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1920px) 960px, (min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_05_Fin_bg.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 384w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Complete_05_Fin_bg.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=