nd drafts replies, so your team resolves more queries, faster.</p></div></div></div><style>@keyframes carouselAutoplay { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }</style><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-0.5 w-full origin-left bg-helpdesk" style="animation:carouselAutoplay linear;opacity:0"></div></button><div class="peer-data-selected:opacity-100 text-body font-sans! font-normal! lg:ml-13 absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-5 ml-11 text-black/70 opacity-60 group-hover/thumb:opacity-80"><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/helpdesk/copilot">Learn more</a></div></div><div class="group/thumb relative flex-1"><button type="button" class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 data-selected:bg-black/3 data-selected:opacity-100 group peer relative flex h-full w-full cursor-pointer flex-col text-left opacity-60 group-hover/thumb:opacity-80 data-selected:flex-1 min-h-32 flex-none overflow-hidden"><div class="flex h-full gap-4 p-6 lg:gap-6 pb-12"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 block size-2 shrink-0 bg-helpdesk"></span><div class="flex flex-col"><h4 class="text-heading-6 flex pb-2">AI-enhanced ticketing</h4><div class="font-sans! font-normal! text-current/70 space-y-3"><p>Convert any conversation into a ticket with one click, automatically categorized, prioritized, and routed to the right team, so every issue reaches the right person, with full context.</p></div></div></div><style>@keyframes carouselAutoplay { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }</style><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-0.5 w-full origin-left bg-helpdesk" style="animation:carouselAutoplay linear;opacity:0"></div></button><div class="peer-data-selected:opacity-100 text-body font-sans! font-normal! lg:ml-13 absolute bottom-0 left-0 mb-5 ml-11 text-black/70 opacity-60 group-hover/thumb:opacity-80"><a class="text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/helpdesk/tickets">Learn more</a></div></div><div class="group/thumb relative flex-1"><button type="button" class="focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 data-selected:bg-black/3 data-selected:opacity-100 group peer relative flex h-full w-full cursor-pointer flex-col text-left opacity-60 group-hover/thumb:opacity-80 data-selected:flex-1 min-h-32 flex-none overflow-hidden"><div class="flex h-full gap-4 p-6 lg:gap-6"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 block size-2 shrink-0 bg-helpdesk"></span><div class="flex flex-col"><h4 class="text-heading-6 flex pb-2">No code automations</h4><div class="font-sans! font-normal! text-current/70 space-y-3"><p>Build powerful automations to route conversations, manage SLAs, and configure escalation triggers, without any engineering support.</p></div></div></div><style>@keyframes carouselAutoplay { from { transform: scaleX(0); } to { transform: scaleX(1); } }</style><div class="absolute left-0 top-0 h-0.5 w-full origin-left bg-helpdesk" style="animation:carouselAutoplay linear;opacity:0"></div></button></div></div></div></div><div class="@4xl:hidden block"><div data-orientation="vertical" dir="ltr" role="region"><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" class="border-linen data-open:bg-off-white data-open:opacity-100 border border-b-0 opacity-60 last:border-b"><h3 data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" class="group"><button type="button" data-value="0" data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-panel-open="" tabindex="0" aria-disabled="false" aria-controls="base-ui-_R_6jb5fknpivodbH1_" aria-expanded="true" id="base-ui-_R_6jb5fknpivodbH2_" class="focus-visible:z-1 group relative items-baseline justify-between text-left focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-blue-800 flex w-full flex-col p-5"><h4 class="text-heading-5 mb-6 flex w-full items-start gap-3"><span class="min-w-0 flex-1">Copilot</span><span class="shrink-0"><span class="group-data-open:hidden block">+</span><span class="group-data-open:block hidden">-</span></span></h4><div class="text-current/70 space-y-2"><p class="text-body font-sans! font-normal! mt-2">Give every agent an AI assistant that pulls context from past conversations, surfaces instant answers from your knowledge base, and drafts replies, so your team resolves more queries, faster.</p></div></button></h3><div data-orientation="vertical" data-index="-1" data-open="" id="base-ui-_R_6jb5fknpivodbH1_" aria-labelledby="base-ui-_R_6jb5fknpivodbH2_" role="region" style="--accordion-panel-height:auto;--accordion-panel-width:auto" class="h-(--accordion-panel-height) data-endingStyle:h-0 data-startingStyle:h-0 overflow-hidden flex flex-col space-y-5 p-5 pt-0"><div><a class="font-sans! font-normal! text-inline-link focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2" href="/helpdesk/copilot">Learn more</a></div><div class="@container size-full"><div class="relative overflow-hidden" style="aspect-ratio:1.029810298102981"><img alt="Decorative ocean water" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="(min-width: 1920px) 1152px, (min-width: 1024px) 60vw, 100vw" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Helpdesk_01_Resolve_01_Copilot_bg.webp&amp;w=384&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 384w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Helpdesk_01_Resolve_01_Copilot_bg.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 640w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Helpdesk_01_Resolve_01_Copilot_bg.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 750w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FIC_Helpdesk_01_Resolve_01_Copilot_bg.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 828w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-mar