ghtspeed</span></figcaption></div><div class="col-span-2 col-start-9 mt-auto hidden md:block"><img alt="Headshot of Angelo Livanos" loading="lazy" width="856" height="1064" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full" style="color:transparent" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FTestimonial_Lightspeed_Angelo.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1x, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FTestimonial_Lightspeed_Angelo.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 2x" src="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fdesktop%2FTestimonial_Lightspeed_Angelo.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK"/></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 text-off-black/20"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></figure></div></div></div></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="text-clay pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 m-3 xl:m-4 hidden md:block"><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current top-0 right-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 left-0"></span><span class="absolute size-2 bg-current bottom-0 right-0"></span></div></section><section data-analytics-region="Partnership" class="bg-off-white container relative mx-auto py-20 md:py-28"><div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-4"><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-subgrid gap-x-4 md:col-span-10 md:col-start-2"><div class="col-span-full mb-6 gap-x-4 md:col-span-10 lg:col-span-7"><h2 class="text-heading-3"><span class="text-current/40 block">A true partner with</span> <!-- -->deep domain expertise</h2></div><div class="col-span-full mb-12 lg:col-span-5 lg:mb-16"><p class="text-body-xl">We partner with you to set up and scale industry-leading customer experiences,<!-- --> <span class="text-current/40">with deep domain expertise, thought leadership, and education to give your team an edge</span></p></div><div class="col-span-full grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"><div data-analytics-region="card-The company you can trust" class="flex flex-col space-y-6"><div class="bg-chalk relative md:hidden text-white" style="aspect-ratio:1"><img alt="Security, reliability and transparency badges" loading="lazy" decoding="async" data-nimg="fill" class="z-1 object-cover" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 640w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 750w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 828w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1080w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1200w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 1920w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2Fimg%2Fhome-2026%2Fmobile%2FIC_Helpdesk_05_Security_Mob.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75&amp;dpl=dpl_2L956ShVEVUkDqoy2XH4Ga913zyK 2048w, /ims-image?url=%2Fintercom-marketing-site%2F